      "subject": "bɛ ŋgɔrɔ",
      "rationale": "נתכה litiral ye 'ka wuli ka ŋgɔrɔ i n'a fɔ tulu' ye — hakilijuguya i n'a fɔ finwulu min bɛ daji"
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Aw ye taa, aw ɲini ⟨את⟩ Yawe ne ye, ani ⟨minnu⟩ toɔrɔ Yisrayɛlɛ (Izrayɛlɛ) ni Yuda kɔnɔ, sɛbɛn in kumaw la min bɛn na; sabu Yawe ka hakilijuguya ka bon, min bɛ ŋgɔrɔ an kan, sabu an ka maw ma ⟨את⟩ Yawe ka kuma mara ka kɛ sɛbɛn in sɛbɛnnen bɛɛ ye.",
